    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "TOM MAHER & COMPANY SCSI RICS IPAV - This warm and inviting 2 bed, 1st floor apartment with parking enjoys well-proportioned, light-filled accommodation complete with balcony which enjoys a north-west aspect overlooking the neatly manicured grounds and views across the city. The property is exceptionally well presented and enjoys tastefully decorated accommodation which exudes a homely feel. The perfect STARTER HOME or INVESTMENT opportunity situated within this exceptionally well-maintained development within minutes of the Luas, The Citywest Shopping Centre, Saggart Village, The Citywest Golf & Leisure complex, local eateries to include the Anvil & Avoca, The Naas road/ N7 & M50 are within a short commute. Early viewing is highly advised in order to fully appreciate its size, convenience and quality of finish. REGISTER YOUR INTEREST BY EMAIL."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance own door to hallway  walk-in storage press with shelving. Separate hot press.\r\nLounge / Kitchen/ Dining room : 3.38m x 8.20m wood flooring neat arrangement of units and presses, tiled splash area.\r\nBedroom 1 : 4.32m x 2.98m built in wardrobes, French door leads to a mock balcony\r\nBedroom 2 : 2.63m x 3.23m built in wardrobes, French door leads to the balcony\r\nSpacious bathroom : 2.57m x 2.98m bath with glass shower screen, pedestal w.h.b. - w.c. - tiled splash areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Double-glazed windows throughout\r\nGas central heating (Baxi boiler)\r\nWired for an alarm system\r\nTrip switch fuse board\r\nModern Kitchen\r\nBoth bedrooms have built-in wardrobes\r\nLift and stairwell\r\nSurface car parking x 2 permits plus visitor / Gated basement parking\r\nService charge circa €1, 950\r\nCuala Property management\r\nBER No 119876878 BER C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "As per the Map - www.tommaher.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "STRICTLY BY PRIOR APPOINTMENT"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "OFFERS",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "FOLLOWING VIEWING of the property - If you intend to bid, you will need to go to the ad on www.daft.ie click on make an offer, you will then need to register... once registered, and satisfactory documentation is received, we will then approve you. You are then in a position to place an offer."
